      "message": "onFrozen only updates mMatchedNetIdWhenFrozen, so if a request is frozen on registration it\u0027s OK not to set it, since it never matched anything before being frozen.\n\nUpdated in the new patchset though, to specify that only callbacks registered when the freezing happens will be frozen.",
